  "introduction": "STORIES OF THE BIBLE UNSHAKABLE: FORMED THROUGH FIRE Join us as we journey through the lives of people like Gideon, Rahab, Daniel, and David. Each week, a different pastor will bring a  fresh perspective to  their  stories-their faith, their struggles, and  the  way  God  moved in  and  through them. Whether youʼre new  to  Jesus, new  to  the  Bible, or  simply hungry to grow in community, this is a space for you. REGISTER CREW ON BREAK? JOIN US FOR SUMMER CLASSES WEDNESDAY, 6:30PM, JULY 1, 8, 15, 22 Step  into  a  deeper kind  of  faith-one that  isnʼt    shaken by pressure, uncertainty, or opposition. Through 1st Peter, weʼll discover how God uses every season, even the hard ones, to form something steady, resilient, and refined in us. This class is  for  those ready to  move beyond surface-level belief and become people who stand firm, live set apart, and carry living hope into the world around them. REGISTER",
