              "type": "text",
              "text": " Habakkuk didn't hide his struggles from God. He honestly expressed the burdens he saw around him and wrestled with questions about why God seemed silent. What burdens are you carrying today, and who has God placed in your life to help you bear them? How can honest prayer and Christian community help you carry what feels overwhelming? Check out "
