                "bookId": "ROM",
                "chapter": 1,
                "verseStart": 16,
                "verseEnd": 17
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\nWhat practical steps can you take to move from anxiety to trust while you wait for God to act? What does it mean to \"live by faith\" when the outcome is uncertain?"
